[A Human,Paladin][O][L 50.48,47.48 Stormwind City]If you missed the earlier *Tome of Divinity* quests and want to learn *Redemption*, start the chain with *Duthorian Rall* in the Cathedral. Accept and turn in Duthorian’s first quest to receive the *Tome of Divinity*. Use the book to start the next quest, then turn it in to Duthorian and accept his follow-up to find *Stephanie Turner*. Bring 10 *Linen Cloth* to Stephanie in the Trade District. Complete her cloth request, accept the reply she gives you, and deliver it to Duthorian. Tick off this reminder if you have reached Duthorian with Stephanie’s reply or want to continue leveling.
